WEBVTT

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.710
Suigintou

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:11.720
Come now, quickly.

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:14.250
It's already 13 past 7.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:16.210
No! Cuddle!

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:18.810
You still don't grasp your position.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.810
Cuddle!

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:20.850
Ouch!

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:22.850
I hate you, Shinku!

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:24.090
Then stand.

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:25.820
No, no, no!

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:29.110
It's like this every morning!
 Enough already!

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:29.820
Jun.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:31.830
It is too early for such a ruckus.

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:37.240
Why should I take all 
this lecturing from you?

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:40.520
Oh, disciplining servants 
is an important task.

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:42.230
Listen, Hina-Ichigo.

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:45.880
A servant's allowed space is up to here.

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:47.170
Oh...

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:48.570
Not "oh."

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:50.180
It should be "yes."

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:51.840
Come, we're going to breakfast.

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:53.850
Open the door for me with this.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:03:01.020
Your foot crossed the line.

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:01.900
Oh!

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.440
Not "oh."

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:05.580
Honestly, whose room
do you think this is?

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:06.730
Mine!

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:08.730
This whole room is mine!

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:11.820
What the hell? 
Making your own rules...

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:13.230
Just who do you think you are?

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:14.800
Sheesh.

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:18.110
Honestly.

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:21.260
Both of you servants 
are being insufferable.

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:24.240
Hina-Ichigo, what are you waiting for?

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:26.740
Hurry up and at least open it.

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:32.120
There, I opened it.

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:33.590
Very good.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.700
Why do I have to be so attentive to her?

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:05.680
Kids are so annoying.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:07.950
Seriously.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.390
Well, help yourselves.

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:14.890
I made it all just for you two.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:18.830
Oh, didn't the sunny-side up eggs
turn out great?

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:23.470
What's wrong, Nori?

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.900
Nothing...

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:26.970
It's okay. It's nothing.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:30.650
Oh, Hina-chan, what's wrong?

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:31.900
Not hungry?

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:36.170
Hina likes the white, 
fluffy, sweet things.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:39.360
White and fluffy...

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:42.950
Oh, I know.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.420
Yogurt, right?

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:47.250
I didn't know you had 
likes and dislikes.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.330
No!

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:54.440
It's nyuu, black, and red!

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.560
Black? Red?

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.080
Oh, a tuna roll...

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:05.080
This is a problem...

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:09.660
Shinku-chan, do you know
what her favorite food is?

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:10.790
I don't.

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:13.820
I don't know anything about
a spoiled servant like her.

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:16.780
Oh, I know.

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:19.620
Hina-chan, draw it for me.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:20.690
Okay!

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:28.040
Done?

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:29.460
Yeah! This!

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:32.750
This?

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:33.870
Yeah, this.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:36.300
Today's fortune from Madam Pearl.

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.810
For those born in April...

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:38.810
Time for Madam Pearl?

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:41.300
Oh no! 
I have to go to school!

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:42.080
You may see an old friend.

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:44.680
Your lucky item is a yellow bag.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:45.740
Sorry, Hina-chan.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.320
I'll get what you want when I'm back.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:48.970
For those born in May...

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:50.880
Don't forget things.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:53.320
You'll be dazed today. 
Your lucky item...

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.670
Well, I'll be going!

00:05:58.220 --> 00:06:00.210
For those born in December...

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:02.590
You might get into a big fight.

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:03.760
Your lucky...

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.810
Hey, Shinku!

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:06.560
Have some tea and calm your mind.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:12.770
Well, I hope you have 
another wonderful day.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:15.110
Cursed
Palace

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:16.780
Six Crest
Dolls

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:17.520
Buy.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:23.620
<i>She's back.</i>

00:06:23.940 --> 00:06:25.620
Hey, what about school?

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:29.800
Tomoe always goes to school.

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:32.270
Nori went to school too.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:34.960
Why...

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:35.870
Shut up.

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:36.960
I'm different.

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:39.700
I don't need to go to a place like that.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:41.970
You're always here?

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:44.420
That's up to me, isn't it?

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:49.220
You're the same as Hina.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:55.890
When Hina is alone,
 I'm told I can't leave that case.

00:06:56.370 --> 00:07:00.420
I'm told to always,
 always stay inside.

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:03.720
So we're the same.

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:09.590
Where are you...

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:11.430
Shut up! 
Where I go...

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:28.310
Damn it.

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:31.120
This is why I hate kids.

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:37.320
Jeez, leaving it open...

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.030
Who did this?

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:48.480
<i>Red and black and unyuu...</i>

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:54.100
<i>Red and black and unyuu...</i>

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:56.820
Oh, cod roe and squid ink pasta!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:01.680
Ah, a splendid dish, Sakurada.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.760
Here, how about a cup of tea?

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.130
No, thank you.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.680
I know the culprit.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:11.050
Oho, who is it?

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:13.520
The culprit is you!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:14.800
G-Goodness!

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:17.770
What proof is there 
that I'm the culprit?

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:20.200
These leopard-print pants!

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:23.370
This was the victim's dying message!

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:25.950
What's it mean, Detective Kun-kun?

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:29.670
If you want to know, 
look up "seal" in the dictionary.

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:32.270
Damn, my alibi was perfect!

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.720
Don't act so shamelessly!

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:36.530
<i>Something's wrong with dolls
watching puppet shows...</i>

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.880
There's no way out!

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:39.160
<i>Well, at least it's quiet.</i>

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:41.660
What is this?

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:42.800
A flower!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:45.480
Here's a butterfly...

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.020
...and this is you!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:48.490
Is it close?

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:50.080
Well, a little...

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:52.590
It's no time to be impressed!

00:08:52.590 --> 00:09:02.340
Great Detective Kun-kun episode 15.
"The Beauty of Mirror Hell."

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.700
No! So dirty!

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.720
What noisy servants.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.250
Be quiet.

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:00.600
Hey, she's your servant, right?

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.620
Isn't it your job
 to look after her?

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:04.340
You're in my way.

00:09:09.050 --> 00:09:11.440
Jun, turn on the TV.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.010
Before I do, listen to...

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:15.450
Ouch, that's hot!

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:18.520
Ow...

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:21.150
What's this?

00:09:21.150 --> 00:09:22.650
It's really sweet.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:26.530
Hina likes this. 
Hina wants to eat it.

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:29.880
It's white and sweet and unyuu.

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:31.650
And it's black and red.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:35.330
White and sweet and unyuu?

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:37.920
Do you know it?

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:41.550
I can't tell from a drawing like this.

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:44.880
Erase the stuff you drew on the floor.

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:49.730
Hina is all alone.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:54.120
No one understands Hina.

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.620
Tomoe understood.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:59.540
I didn't say anything
 and she bought them.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.960
Then go back.

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:03.490
I'd be happier then too!

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:04.860
I want to!

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:08.870
Hina wants to go back to Tomoe.

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:12.540
But I can't be with her!

00:10:14.980 --> 00:10:17.710
Did something happen?

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.990
Tomoe no longer has the ring.

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:22.640
The ring?

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:28.200
Without the ring, we cannot
obtain power from our mediums.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.890
Hina-Ichigo is here now...

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:35.530
...because I'm sharing the power
I derive from you.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:40.030
Hina-Ichigo can no longer
stray far from you and me.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.010
<i>I still hate kids.</i>

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.170
<i>Crying like that...</i>

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.520
<i>It irritates me somehow.</i>

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:09.900
<i>That's all.</i>

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:11.760
<i>That's all, okay?</i>

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:37.050
Damn it.

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:48.020
<i>I'm told to always,
 always stay inside.</i>

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:51.500
<i>So we're the same.</i>

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:53.130
<i>I'm...</i>

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.900
What is the matter, Madam Rabbit?

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:14.100
Detective Kun-kun, let's break down
the door and get inside!

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:45.350
Japanese Confections
Satoh

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:51.560
Hey, he's not here.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:54.400
Where did Jun go?

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:58.560
Honestly, how dare he leave
without my permission.

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.570
The only place left is over there.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.610
Shinku, what's this room?

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:12.340
Yes, I'll show you.

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:19.460
It's a pretty place for this house,
but this is no room.

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:21.550
I know! 
The bathroom!

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:23.120
Yes.

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:26.460
Don't tell me that you 
didn't know, Shinku?

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:30.220
You speak impudently for a servant.

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:36.320
It won't open?

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:37.620
Something is strange.

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:47.110
Sorry, I just sold out.

00:13:47.530 --> 00:13:49.660
I could put some aside tomorrow.

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:51.360
Oh...

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:53.250
That's all right.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.500
Come again.

00:14:02.060 --> 00:14:03.590
This late already?

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.870
If they don't have it here...

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.600
It's gotta be at the other shop...

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:21.580
Shinku, you're heavy!

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:24.590
Don't tell a lady that she's heavy.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:25.510
Just bear it.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:29.300
I-I-I-I can't hold on anymore!

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:33.790
Shinku, Hina wants to go out too!

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:36.160
No, you stay there.

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:37.270
What?

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:39.660
That's mean, Shinku!

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:43.650
Come on, Hina wants to come too!

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:50.970
There.

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:00.070
This is...

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:04.320
Shinku, is that you?

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:05.550
I'm opening it.

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:13.430
These...

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:16.060
Hina-Ichigo, stay close to me.

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:18.800
Show yourself already...

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:20.470
...Suigintou.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:27.210
Hina-Ichigo, behind me.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:28.210
Okay!

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:51.950
It's been 586,920 hours and 37 minutes
since last time, Shinku.

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:54.670
So you awoke too.

00:15:55.360 --> 00:15:57.700
Oh? I made it known.

00:15:58.210 --> 00:15:59.700
Didn't you notice?

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:01.900
Then as I thought...

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:05.460
...you were in control of that doll.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:10.040
Just a little greeting.

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:11.440
More importantly...

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:16.010
...why is a defeated participant
of the game here, Hina-Ichigo?

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:22.480
The losing doll furthers the victor's growth
with her Rosa Mystica.

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:24.460
Those are the Alice Game's rules.

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:28.380
You two have profaned the sacred game.

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:32.470
Mind your own business.
I have my own methods.

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:35.010
Even if it should anger Father?

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:40.760
If you have a problem, I don't mind
challenging you right now.

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:44.720
You're as ugly as ever when angry.

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:45.650
Quiet.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.770
You cannot defeat me with 
something like this.

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:03.970
Never mind.

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:09.470
It's no fun unless I take my time
to torment you dummies slowly.

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:11.480
Later.

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:13.680
Suigintou!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:15.950
Wait!

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:23.420
Suigintou...

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:27.220
Pedestrians and Bicyclists Only

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:46.550
That was dangerous!

00:17:46.550 --> 00:17:47.660
Watch it!

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:57.330
I bought it.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:56.780
Crap.

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:58.150
Really?

00:17:58.150 --> 00:17:59.350
It was that cute?

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:00.940
It was.

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:02.300
I'll show you next time.

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:03.220
Show me!

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.260
Come over.

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:05.390
I will.

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:09.870
You won't go to the arcade?

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.170
No money.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:12.990
Your place then.

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:14.040
Onoda and Itoh.

00:18:12.990 --> 00:18:14.040
What's that mean?

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:15.800
Well, I mean...

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:19.510
Damn, I shouldn't have gone out.

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:24.220
But if I went home now, 
I'd be a total idiot...

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:25.510
Man...

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:35.390
Um...

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.030
Sakurada-kun.

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:42.030
Soft Rice Cakes

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:41.240
Why are you here?

00:18:48.120 --> 00:18:50.860
Good work figuring out 
her favorite food.

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:52.100
I guess.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.890
Well, I'll go home now.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:00.250
Say...

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.410
Those dolls...

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:05.580
What do you think they are?

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:11.320
She appeared at my place suddenly too.

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:16.300
One day, 
I got a phone call.

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.700
Kashiwaba residence.

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:26.050
<i>Will you wind?</i>

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:27.680
<i>Or not wind?</i>

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:32.970
At first, I was scared.

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:36.510
I even thought about
throwing her away in her sleep.

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:40.520
But I found out something living with...

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:43.320
and being with Hina-Ichigo.

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:47.020
That she was very lonely.

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.570
What those dolls are...

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:54.520
Where they came from
 and what their purpose is...

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.100
I don't know either.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.940
But I can say one thing.

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:03.610
Those girls need you.

00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:07.970
Both Hina-Ichigo and 
that doll named Shinku.

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:15.920
Truthfully, I was worried when
Hina-Ichigo went to stay with you.

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:19.130
But I feel a little relieved now.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:22.930
Take care of Hina.

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:41.140
There you are!

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:43.810
Where were you?

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:45.380
We had trouble!

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:46.340
Trouble?

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:48.920
Shinku and Suigin...

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:48.920
Hina-Ichigo.

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:51.020
It was nothing.

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:55.950
I'm home!

00:20:57.100 --> 00:20:58.060
Here.

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:00.170
Hina-chan, look. I got...

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:03.650
Oh? Jun-kun, those clothes...

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:04.730
It's nothing...

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:08.070
Oh! This is the unyuu!

00:21:13.610 --> 00:21:17.100
So it was soft rice 
cakes with strawberries.

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:18.530
Unyuu.

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:19.820
So sweet.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:21.250
So tasty.

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:23.610
Jun, thank you.

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:25.270
It wasn't me.

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:31.920
I didn't ask for tea.

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:33.000
It's thanks.

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:38.800
Hina likes you now,
 so it's thanks.

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:41.800
I love you, Jun!

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:44.850
Whoa! Hey, hold on!

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:47.270
Your cheek's so smooth!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:47.270
S-Stop it!

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:50.980
Cheek! Cheek! Yay! Yay!

00:23:41.950 --> 00:23:44.160
Shinku-chan, time for tea.

00:23:44.160 --> 00:23:44.950
Unacceptable.

00:23:45.170 --> 00:23:46.400
Make it again.

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:48.100
Without tasting?

00:23:48.100 --> 00:23:49.520
I can tell.

00:23:49.520 --> 00:23:50.980
You need more practice.

00:23:50.980 --> 00:23:52.500
I practiced so hard...

00:23:52.770 --> 00:23:53.750
in my dreams.

00:23:53.750 --> 00:23:55.120
How infinitely pointless.

00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:57.440
If she were here,

00:23:57.440 --> 00:24:01.120
I could teach you
to make tea in your dreams.

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:02.540
In my dreams?

00:24:02.810 --> 00:24:04.800
Next time on Rozen Maiden...

00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:07.480
Swear upon this rose ring.

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:10.980
Chapter 4
Suiseiseki
